    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I meant that this should be enough:\r\n\r\n```\r\nwarning(condition, message);\r\n\r\n// becomes\r\n\r\n__DEV__ ? warning(condition, message) : void 0;\r\n\r\n// instead of\r\n\r\n__DEV__ ? !condition ? warning(false, message) : void 0 : void 0;\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot sure why that extra wrapper is necessary :) ",
    "commit_id": "91f728ebf01087d99ff47996fab913f5908a1d31",
